  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0279.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">El alumnado de 4&ordm; de Primaria del colegio Mestre Caballero de Onda ha visitado la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes el Toll d&#39;Ascla, donde una monitora del Grup Au les ha explicado las diferentes especies de fauna y flora, han podido&nbsp;observar el &#39;toll&#39; y han realizado varios ejercicios.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0275.jpg\" alt=\"img_0275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0276.jpg\" alt=\"img_0276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0277.jpg\" alt=\"img_0277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0278.jpg\" alt=\"img_0278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0279.jpg\" alt=\"img_0279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0280.jpg\" alt=\"img_0280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0281.jpg\" alt=\"img_0281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballerotollascla/img_0330.jpg\" alt=\"img_0330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a97